                "markdown": "Regex `$X` may be vulnerable to catastrophic backtracking, which may lead to denial of service attacks. (This rule only matches regex usage, not actual REDoS patterns. For full detection, use Semgrep Pro Engine.)\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://r2c.dev/blog/2020/finding-python-redos-bugs-at-scale-using-dlint-and-r2c/](https://r2c.dev/blog/2020/finding-python-redos-bugs-at-scale-using-dlint-and-r2c/)\n - [https://r2c.dev/blog/2020/improving-redos-detection-with-dlint-and-r2c/](https://r2c.dev/blog/2020/improving-redos-detection-with-dlint-and-r2c/)\n"
